      "title": "File:Plaskett telescope Dominion Astrophysical Observatory Canada 1920.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/Plaskett_telescope_Dominion_Astrophysical_Observatory_Canada_1920.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
